1
00:00:02,255 --> 00:00:03,385
Namaste Doctor.

2
00:00:03,385 --> 00:00:07,450
This is a quick tour of your Ayurveda clinic software.

3
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:13,173
We will follow one patient from login to billing, and then see the settings.

4
00:00:13,173 --> 00:00:16,485
All patients you see here are demo patients.

5
00:00:22,726 --> 00:00:24,358
First, secure login.

6
00:00:24,358 --> 00:00:28,765
Each staff member has their own username and password.

7
00:00:28,765 --> 00:00:33,661
Doctors and admins also enter a one-time password, an O T P.

8
00:00:33,661 --> 00:00:36,925
In this test version it shows on screen.

9
00:00:36,925 --> 00:00:40,026
In your clinic, it comes on the phone.

10
00:00:47,415 --> 00:00:49,077
This is your dashboard.

11
00:00:49,077 --> 00:00:51,389
The top row shows today's O P D:

12
00:00:51,389 --> 00:00:55,942
how many are waiting, with the doctor, finished, and the total.

13
00:00:55,942 --> 00:00:58,471
The second row shows today's money:

14
00:00:58,471 --> 00:01:03,602
O P D and pharmacy collection, the total, and what is still to collect.

15
00:01:03,602 --> 00:01:06,565
One look, and you know your clinic's day.

16
00:01:15,623 --> 00:01:19,942
The whole screen can change language with one click.

17
00:01:19,942 --> 00:01:20,690
Gujarati.

18
00:01:20,690 --> 00:01:21,188
Hindi.

19
00:01:21,188 --> 00:01:22,849
And back to English.

20
00:01:22,849 --> 00:01:28,413
Your staff can work in the language they are most comfortable with.

21
00:01:32,339 --> 00:01:33,033
Patients.

22
00:01:33,033 --> 00:01:35,577
Every patient has one unique I D.

23
00:01:35,577 --> 00:01:40,126
Search by name, I D or mobile number, and filter by gender.

24
00:01:40,126 --> 00:01:47,374
Mobile numbers are partly hidden for privacy, and allergies show as a small red tag, so nobody

25
00:01:47,374 --> 00:01:48,299
misses them.

26
00:01:55,766 --> 00:01:59,270
Open a patient, and you see the complete file.

27
00:01:59,270 --> 00:02:06,431
Details, medical history, which is kept encrypted, all check-ups, vitals over time, documents,

28
00:02:06,431 --> 00:02:11,535
appointments, consent, and an activity log of who opened this file.

29
00:02:11,535 --> 00:02:14,506
One patient, one file, in every branch.

30
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:19,378
Registering a new patient is simple.

31
00:02:19,378 --> 00:02:22,871
Only name, age and mobile number are compulsory.

32
00:02:22,871 --> 00:02:29,565
Then address, referral, and medical history with one-click chips for diabetes, B P, thyroid,

33
00:02:29,565 --> 00:02:31,966
acidity and more, plus allergies.

34
00:02:31,966 --> 00:02:38,296
At the bottom is patient consent, as the new data protection law requires, shown in the

35
00:02:38,296 --> 00:02:39,969
patient's own language.

36
00:02:59,466 --> 00:03:00,483
Appointments.

37
00:03:00,483 --> 00:03:05,411
See the day's list with time, patient, doctor, status and bill.

38
00:03:05,411 --> 00:03:07,523
Filter by doctor or status.

39
00:03:07,523 --> 00:03:14,721
Book a new appointment by choosing patient, doctor and a free slot, or use Walk-in to give a

40
00:03:14,721 --> 00:03:16,286
token straight away.

41
00:03:21,887 --> 00:03:24,081
The queue page is for reception.

42
00:03:24,081 --> 00:03:29,362
It shows who is with each doctor and who is waiting, and refreshes by itself.

43
00:03:29,362 --> 00:03:35,397
There is also a T V screen for the waiting room, so patients can see their token number.

44
00:03:43,305 --> 00:03:45,941
Now your main screen, the check-up.

45
00:03:45,941 --> 00:03:48,426
Today's patients are on the left.

46
00:03:48,426 --> 00:03:54,075
Click one, and the allergies and known conditions appear in red at the top.

47
00:03:54,075 --> 00:03:59,874
Then record complaints with one click, write history notes, and enter vitals.

48
00:03:59,874 --> 00:04:02,435
B M I is calculated automatically.

49
00:04:07,933 --> 00:04:10,734
This is what makes it truly Ayurvedic.

50
00:04:10,734 --> 00:04:16,484
Ashtavidha Pariksha, the eight-fold examination, is ready with simple options.

51
00:04:16,484 --> 00:04:23,192
So are Dashavidha Pariksha, Agni and daily habits, and a Prakriti questionnaire that scores

52
00:04:23,192 --> 00:04:24,813
Vata, Pitta and Kapha.

53
00:04:24,813 --> 00:04:27,393
All questions can be edited by you.

54
00:04:36,238 --> 00:04:41,066
Next, diagnosis, with common Ayurvedic diagnoses ready to select.

55
00:04:41,066 --> 00:04:42,700
Then the prescription.

56
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:49,682
Type a few letters of a medicine, in English, Sanskrit, Hindi or Gujarati, and it appears with

57
00:04:49,682 --> 00:04:53,618
safety warnings, for example for metals or pregnancy.

58
00:04:53,618 --> 00:04:57,035
Save your favourite combinations as templates.

59
00:04:57,035 --> 00:05:01,418
Then add advice, set the follow-up, and complete the visit.

60
00:05:05,272 --> 00:05:11,749
The medicine master has classical medicines with Ayurvedic Formulary references, and patent

61
00:05:11,749 --> 00:05:13,315
medicines with brands.

62
00:05:13,315 --> 00:05:16,589
Each shows form, safety tags, price and G S T.

63
00:05:16,589 --> 00:05:23,279
Search by any synonym, set price and on or off for each branch, add new medicines, or import a

64
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:24,062
whole list.

65
00:05:32,205 --> 00:05:32,806
Billing.

66
00:05:32,806 --> 00:05:39,045
The top shows today's bills, cash, U P I and card, refunds, cash in hand and G S T.

67
00:05:39,045 --> 00:05:45,885
One bill can combine consultation, therapies and medicines, and bill numbers are automatic,

68
00:05:45,885 --> 00:05:47,013
never repeated.

69
00:05:47,013 --> 00:05:47,915
Open a bill:

70
00:05:47,915 --> 00:05:53,628
a clean print with the amount in words and a U P I Q R code to pay by phone.

71
00:05:53,628 --> 00:05:56,409
Print on A4, A5 or a thermal printer.

72
00:05:56,409 --> 00:05:58,965
A cancelled bill is never deleted.

73
00:06:06,549 --> 00:06:07,217
Pharmacy.

74
00:06:07,217 --> 00:06:13,528
To dispense shows the doctor's prescriptions, so the pharmacist does not write again.

75
00:06:13,528 --> 00:06:20,359
Then sales and returns, bills, batch-wise stock with expiry dates, purchases, and suppliers.

76
00:06:20,359 --> 00:06:23,329
You can switch off what you do not need.

77
00:06:26,913 --> 00:06:33,045
In Fees and Services, set each doctor's fee for a new case and for a follow-up, and how many

78
00:06:33,045 --> 00:06:34,978
days a follow-up stays valid.

79
00:06:34,978 --> 00:06:40,643
Below is your list of services, like Agnikarma or dressing, ready to add to any bill.

80
00:06:45,859 --> 00:06:49,338
Check-up templates hold the questions you saw.

81
00:06:49,338 --> 00:06:53,120
Edit any question, add options, or build your own.

82
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:57,809
Every change makes a new version, so old records never change.

83
00:07:02,238 --> 00:07:03,187
Clinic setup.

84
00:07:03,187 --> 00:07:08,740
Add rooms, add staff with their own logins, and use roles to control access.

85
00:07:08,740 --> 00:07:15,607
For example, a therapist cannot see billing, and a pharmacist cannot see full patient history.

86
00:07:15,607 --> 00:07:20,648
Doctor schedules set each doctor's days and timings for appointments.

87
00:07:26,869 --> 00:07:34,126
Settings holds your clinic name, G S T I N, phone and address, which print on every bill, the

88
00:07:34,126 --> 00:07:37,638
patient I D prefix, and the default language.

89
00:07:37,638 --> 00:07:40,057
Today you work with one branch.

90
00:07:40,057 --> 00:07:43,880
When you open a second branch, just switch it on.

91
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:45,129
Nothing is lost.

92
00:07:48,048 --> 00:07:55,121
Additional settings switch optional features on or off, like pharmacy bills, discounts, stock

93
00:07:55,121 --> 00:07:56,185
and purchases.

94
00:07:56,185 --> 00:07:58,847
Switching off only hides a feature.

95
00:07:58,847 --> 00:08:00,748
Nothing saved is deleted.

96
00:08:03,757 --> 00:08:05,413
Finally, the audit log.

97
00:08:05,413 --> 00:08:07,933
Every login and change is recorded:

98
00:08:07,933 --> 00:08:10,813
who, when, from where, and which record.

99
00:08:10,813 --> 00:08:17,437
These entries can never be edited or deleted, which helps you follow the data protection law

100
00:08:17,437 --> 00:08:19,957
and keeps patient information safe.

101
00:08:27,029 --> 00:08:29,584
That was the full patient journey:

102
00:08:29,584 --> 00:08:36,123
appointment, registration, Ayurvedic check-up, prescription, billing and pharmacy, with

103
00:08:36,123 --> 00:08:37,401
privacy built in.

104
00:08:37,401 --> 00:08:41,235
Panchakarma plans and diet charts are planned next.

105
00:08:41,235 --> 00:08:44,016
Please tell us what to change or add.

106
00:08:44,016 --> 00:08:45,369
Thank you, Doctor.
